{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"Don't leave your trash here.|Take it home."},{"id":"s2","text":"All froze.|Wrong move."},{"id":"s3","text":"Tray in hand.|All stare."},{"id":"s4","text":"Same hands.|Into the bag."},{"id":"s5","text":"Bag closed.|She smiles."},{"id":"s6","text":"She shouted—"},{"id":"s7","text":"She grills on.|We just wait."},{"id":"s8","text":"Bag packed.|Vendor beams."},{"id":"s9","text":"No bins here.|That's the rule."},{"id":"n1","text":"No bins here.|Ten thousand people."},{"id":"n2","text":"Take it home.|In your bag."},{"id":"n3","text":"Bagged and done.|Street stays clean."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}